    "introduction": "Aberdeen Group provides investment and wealth-related services, including asset management and platforms used by individual investors and advisers. Its businesses connect customers with funds, portfolios and tools for holding and managing savings. Revenue comes from investment-management fees and platform charges, with the structure varying between services. Market movements influence the value of client assets, while customer inflows and withdrawals affect commercial scale. The group must balance investment expertise with technology and distribution in a competitive savings market. Performance depends on attracting and retaining clients, maintaining efficient operations and offering products that meet changing preferences for advice, self-directed investing and different asset classes.",
